00:41:21.260 --> 00:41:22.060
It's all right. Stay.

00:41:31.660 --> 00:41:34.660
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:41:40.556 --> 00:41:42.556
Why don't you go to school, Miguelito?

00:41:43.532 --> 00:41:44.632
We have conquests.

00:41:44.876 --> 00:41:45.876
Jealous?

00:41:45.996 --> 00:41:47.796
It seems that it hit you hard.

00:41:47.980 --> 00:41:49.140
What's going on, huh?

00:41:49.260 --> 00:41:51.260
From this one, I'll put up an academy!

00:41:51.660 --> 00:41:53.960
Well, why don't you get me something fresh?

00:41:53.960 --> 00:41:54.700
A grapa.

00:41:54.764 --> 00:41:56.004
No, a funny one.

00:41:56.004 --> 00:41:56.504
Okay.

00:41:56.588 --> 00:41:57.548
Let's see if he stays.

00:41:57.772 --> 00:41:58.772
I'll be right back.

00:42:00.250 --> 00:42:02.310
Don't worry, he's a good guy.

00:42:03.430 --> 00:42:05.130
But mine is a bummer.

00:42:05.530 --> 00:42:07.690
But I assure you I'll get him out of line.

00:42:07.890 --> 00:42:10.240
If I had a character as cheerful as yours.

00:42:11.400 --> 00:42:13.040
Don't you realize he really loves you?

00:42:13.660 --> 00:42:15.900
No, darling, I won't convince him.

00:42:16.260 --> 00:42:17.870
I don't know why.

00:42:18.910 --> 00:42:19.790
Can I have a minute?

00:42:20.030 --> 00:42:20.650
Yes, go on.

00:42:20.970 --> 00:42:24.980
Hey, where are you going with that?

00:42:25.200 --> 00:42:26.460
To the port. What a question?

00:42:26.660 --> 00:42:27.400
I'll go with the pipe.

00:42:27.580 --> 00:42:29.570
Excuse me, excuse me. How are you, girl?

00:42:30.060 --> 00:42:32.630
In the buffet there's something good. Here's the order.

00:42:32.950 --> 00:42:34.970
But what's he bringing me? A glass of milk?

00:42:35.330 --> 00:42:36.570
And what does he want? That I bring him the cow?

00:42:36.790 --> 00:42:38.950
Come on, Miguelito, you don't have to be like that with the women.

00:42:39.260 --> 00:42:39.520
Thanks.

00:42:39.950 --> 00:42:41.230
Will you allow me a frankness, old man?

00:42:41.330 --> 00:42:43.710
Look, I'm not going to finish understanding women.

00:42:45.000 --> 00:42:48.720
Let's go to the buffet? Hey, you! Where were you?

00:42:49.040 --> 00:42:50.440
At the buffet, they're waiting for you for chocolate.

00:42:50.820 --> 00:42:51.390
Shall we?

00:42:51.730 --> 00:42:52.310
No, thanks.

00:42:52.530 --> 00:42:53.490
A chocolate, huh?

00:42:53.570 --> 00:42:53.710
No.

00:42:54.030 --> 00:42:55.100
Shall we dance, then?

00:43:01.440 --> 00:43:01.840
You're already in.

00:43:02.160 --> 00:43:03.390
But there's a return.

00:43:03.970 --> 00:43:04.750
You're already in.

00:43:05.440 --> 00:43:06.860
It's just that I'm coming with the miss, you know.

00:43:06.940 --> 00:43:07.720
You're already in.

00:43:08.320 --> 00:43:09.160
Don't you give me the rematch?

00:43:09.340 --> 00:43:10.360
You're already in.

00:43:10.780 --> 00:43:17.730
Are you going to leave Carlos?

00:43:18.090 --> 00:43:19.160
Just a little while.

00:43:19.360 --> 00:43:20.500
Nothing more than a friend?

00:43:20.720 --> 00:43:21.540
Nothing more, Ana Maria.

00:43:21.760 --> 00:43:23.120
If the only one I want is you.

00:43:37.740 --> 00:43:40.000
You know what I'm looking for.

00:43:41.450 --> 00:43:44.830
I've spent my life spreading smiles and cordiality.

00:43:44.970 --> 00:43:47.870
I think I have no enemies because I don't play dirty with anyone.

00:43:48.690 --> 00:43:50.590
But if you don't know, you can't even be my friend.

00:43:51.240 --> 00:43:56.860
There's the door. I'll return it to you whenever and wherever you want.

00:43:56.940 --> 00:43:58.980
At midnight, in Palarneda's attic.

00:43:59.220 --> 00:43:59.740
As a lock.

00:44:04.760 --> 00:44:06.100
You'll come too, won't you?

00:44:06.220 --> 00:44:08.620
I mean you, baby.

00:44:08.900 --> 00:44:10.680
Me? No one invited me.

00:44:10.840 --> 00:44:11.600
Well, I'll invite you.

00:44:11.880 --> 00:44:13.620
Yes, of course.

00:44:13.740 --> 00:44:14.100
Look.

00:44:15.810 --> 00:44:16.150
Let's go.

00:44:16.290 --> 00:44:19.160
Looks like he invited me, doesn't he?

00:44:19.220 --> 00:44:24.460
I don't want you to go, baby.

00:44:24.740 --> 00:44:26.460
I never miss where you need me.

00:44:34.480 --> 00:44:37.830
You see, Carlos and that man, they're going to fight.

00:44:38.070 --> 00:44:42.690
And that woman, come on, all this is too much for me.

00:44:42.870 --> 00:44:51.940
Ana María, why are you leaving?

00:44:52.240 --> 00:44:53.320
And you still ask me?

00:44:53.400 --> 00:44:56.340
You're all the same, you prefer that other one.

00:44:56.360 --> 00:44:56.620
But...

00:44:56.620 --> 00:44:59.280
Leave me, it will be better if you forget about me.

00:44:59.540 --> 00:44:59.960
Come on.

00:45:03.200 --> 00:45:05.310
Tejana, go and understand women.

00:45:05.990 --> 00:45:17.300
Look at her, she said she loved me.

00:45:20.600 --> 00:45:24.220
Look at her, she's going to dance with me.

00:45:24.520 --> 00:45:27.620
And she said she loved me.

00:45:31.880 --> 00:45:40.620
I leave you and me of the love that would leave me

00:45:42.030 --> 00:45:59.010
as it is, if you leave me and me

00:46:00.540 --> 00:46:07.530
Only one thing I ask of you, if you leave me and leave me alone

00:46:08.410 --> 00:46:16.520
Only one thing I ask of you, that you don't drink from that water and from me

00:46:16.920 --> 00:46:24.360
From the fort of Lourdes

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:59.050
as we wait more morocho look I knew that the big head was not going to come

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:00.900
You can't fight with anyone.

00:47:01.080 --> 00:47:03.100
I don't think Gurruchaga is a man of weakness.

00:47:03.440 --> 00:47:05.080
We're getting so little handsome, son.

00:47:05.280 --> 00:47:07.160
Eh, Che? Who's that dragging himself there?

00:47:07.260 --> 00:47:08.280
Ah, no, it's a dog.

00:47:09.460 --> 00:47:11.260
Dani, let's find out where he lives.

00:47:11.360 --> 00:47:13.880
But Che, what need do you have to go and bother him at this hour?

00:47:14.040 --> 00:47:14.780
Dani, let's go, let's go.

00:47:14.840 --> 00:47:16.380
But look how capricious you are, Morocho, eh?

00:47:16.380 --> 00:47:17.840
When you get something in your head...

00:48:20.160 --> 00:48:29.410
You see, it was the Vigil, I'm sorry to see now.

00:48:40.910 --> 00:48:47.050
Come, my friend. Take everything I have.

00:48:47.070 --> 00:48:49.920
And bury her decently on the ground.

00:48:53.990 --> 00:48:54.570
Thank you, my love.

00:49:11.740 --> 00:49:12.400
I don't want to get here again.

00:49:31.210 --> 00:49:35.610
How long will you take? I'll never wait for you with so much fear.

00:49:40.440 --> 00:49:41.340
Come, old woman.

00:49:47.180 --> 00:49:49.380
For my dear mother,

00:49:52.080 --> 00:49:56.340
how much displeasure she gave her.

00:49:58.900 --> 00:49:59.740
Cry, old woman.

00:50:02.680 --> 00:50:03.840
It doesn't matter that I'm here.

00:50:04.800 --> 00:50:11.590
What matters is that you're by my side, that you're always by my side.

00:50:32.080 --> 00:50:34.740
We have to help him, because Carlitos is a good boy.

00:50:35.270 --> 00:50:36.030
You understand, don't you?

00:50:38.890 --> 00:50:40.310
Isabel, damn it!

00:50:40.530 --> 00:50:42.410
You can make Ana Maria listen to him.

00:50:42.870 --> 00:50:44.990
What a comedy! Why do you get involved in this?

00:50:45.370 --> 00:50:47.250
Because I can't let any friend attack her.

00:50:47.700 --> 00:50:50.660
Ah, you men only serve to make a woman suffer.

00:50:51.400 --> 00:50:53.510
No, Isabel.

00:50:53.960 --> 00:50:56.300
So you mean that you suffer for me,

00:50:56.400 --> 00:50:59.210
even if it's just a little bit like that.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:00.580
Half-tooth.

00:51:02.840 --> 00:51:03.780
I'm going to do you a favor.

00:51:03.940 --> 00:51:06.780
Not for you, but for Carlos and Ana María.

00:51:08.690 --> 00:51:08.790
Yes.

00:51:09.370 --> 00:51:10.310
And now, what do you want?

00:51:10.450 --> 00:51:12.040
Give me a kiss.

00:51:12.840 --> 00:51:13.620
With a slap in the face.

00:51:13.870 --> 00:51:15.750
One day you're going to ask for it with your knees.

00:51:33.740 --> 00:51:34.600
Carlos, I...

00:51:34.600 --> 00:51:36.410
No, don't say anything.

00:51:36.570 --> 00:51:37.570
What for?

00:51:38.860 --> 00:51:39.960
If you're with me again...

00:51:41.290 --> 00:51:42.170
I love you, Carlos.

00:51:43.260 --> 00:51:44.500
I love you with all my heart.

00:51:45.800 --> 00:51:47.940
You're still the girlfriend of San José de Flores,

00:51:49.300 --> 00:51:51.520
the good and faithful girl who always comes back.

00:51:52.520 --> 00:51:55.070
Look, in these days that I haven't seen you,

00:51:55.130 --> 00:51:57.230
it's as if I hadn't had the sun,

00:51:57.950 --> 00:51:59.310
nor the desire to sing for you.

00:52:00.440 --> 00:52:03.810
And I only know how to tell you that I love you, that I didn't forget you.

00:52:05.080 --> 00:52:06.480
But my heart is not deceived.

00:52:06.680 --> 00:52:12.280
I was born to succeed, so that all women will love you.

00:52:12.900 --> 00:52:13.680
Don't talk like that.

00:52:14.870 --> 00:52:17.600
Another, in my case, would wish your defeat.

00:52:17.880 --> 00:52:20.760
On the other hand, I don't want to be a hindrance in your path.

00:52:20.960 --> 00:52:23.880
Come on, Carlos.

00:52:25.680 --> 00:52:26.560
You're hurting me, Ana María.

00:52:27.060 --> 00:52:28.880
No, I'm not the one who's hurting you.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:31.540
Life is the one that takes you away from me.

00:52:32.140 --> 00:52:33.620
You were born to triumph.

00:52:34.520 --> 00:52:36.580
You will become the singer of Buenos Aires.

00:52:37.540 --> 00:52:39.600
And all the neighborhoods will pray for your name.

00:52:40.810 --> 00:52:42.490
How little will you look like then.

00:52:43.090 --> 00:52:45.950
The little house of San José de Flores.

00:52:47.780 --> 00:52:49.760
And this bride dressed as Percal.

00:52:49.920 --> 00:52:51.780
Are you dreaming?

00:52:52.060 --> 00:52:57.290
No one can twist her dress. You have to go.

00:52:58.550 --> 00:52:59.690
Why do you insist on leaving me?

00:53:01.050 --> 00:53:01.790
I don't understand you.

00:53:02.390 --> 00:53:03.570
I know why I told you.

00:53:04.970 --> 00:53:08.020
Come on, Carla. It will be better for you.

00:53:10.570 --> 00:53:11.310
And for you too.

00:53:20.200 --> 00:53:20.460
Goodbye.

00:53:20.820 --> 00:53:28.450
She drowned in Buenos Aires.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:35.760
Since oblivion can be handled anywhere, he left his old and beloved neighborhood of La Basta.

00:53:35.860 --> 00:53:43.800
The bird to whom the doors of the cage opened flew into the field carrying the guitar and the enchanted magic of his voice.

00:54:00.890 --> 00:54:05.930
The morning is enchanted

00:54:07.170 --> 00:54:11.900
The star has a light

00:54:17.300 --> 00:54:28.960
The perfume of the flowers has pure strength, the countryside has freshness.

00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:34.830
I sing soft songs

00:54:35.690 --> 00:54:41.370
Gojeos have the slaves

00:54:43.070 --> 00:54:51.350
I'm crazy about Marguerite

00:55:00.250 --> 00:55:05.200
He sang in the pulperías, which opened in the challenging cordiality of the tome and oblige,

00:55:05.240 --> 00:55:07.400
on the side of towns and cities.

00:55:47.530 --> 00:55:54.070
The voice made the miracle that in the gaucho bonfires, the mate suspended its

00:55:54.070 --> 00:55:59.800
grooves, amenized the pause of the carts tired of untwisting the road.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:00.600
...and dusty wines.

00:56:30.440 --> 00:56:33.980
You are the sound in cordón

00:56:33.980 --> 00:56:37.680
I am a little gaucho singer

00:56:37.680 --> 00:56:43.060
You are the best garment

00:56:43.060 --> 00:56:47.070
Of my walking hat

00:56:47.070 --> 00:56:54.990
You are the sapper of my sobeo

00:56:57.180 --> 00:56:57.840
Rienda

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:02.080
of my neighborhood.

00:57:02.740 --> 00:57:08.540
He sang in the Creole ranches

00:57:08.540 --> 00:57:11.980
where the privilege of his white and cordial laugh was disputed.

00:57:11.980 --> 00:57:15.410
And it was a party at the party of 100 provincial patios

00:57:15.410 --> 00:57:18.400
where they heard ecstatic his baronil singing.

00:57:18.540 --> 00:57:26.750
In a pingo-pangaré

00:57:27.530 --> 00:57:29.640
with a coscojero brake

00:57:30.860 --> 00:57:33.100
Buena raja, buena perua

00:57:33.640 --> 00:57:37.140
En dirección pa'l Pehuel

00:57:37.700 --> 00:57:43.700
Los maletíes

00:57:43.700 --> 00:57:46.160
Por allá

00:57:47.300 --> 00:57:48.300
Cañada

00:57:48.300 --> 00:57:52.680
Con camisa bien planchada

00:57:52.680 --> 00:57:55.460
Un clavel rojo retinto

00:57:56.530 --> 00:57:58.730
Puñal de plata en el cinto

00:58:00.090 --> 00:58:01.590
And a strong and bright vote

00:58:03.150 --> 00:58:10.700
After a long run

00:58:10.700 --> 00:58:13.620
And at the end of the race

00:58:14.200 --> 00:58:17.320
And there, next to the tarantula

00:58:18.220 --> 00:58:21.560
Where I will find my illusion

00:58:30.640 --> 00:58:37.370
And I'm juggling the corset with honey words

00:58:37.370 --> 00:58:39.230
And I'm squeezing his hand

00:58:40.590 --> 00:58:43.070
Although I'm a poor peasant

00:58:43.070 --> 00:58:46.650
Take, keep this key

00:58:48.190 --> 00:58:50.920
How are you, Celedonio?

00:58:50.940 --> 00:58:51.660
What's up, Jacinto?

00:58:51.820 --> 00:58:53.860
Good afternoon, I was looking for...

00:58:53.860 --> 00:58:54.600
Permission

00:59:03.390 --> 00:59:04.890
What are you doing here, Miguelito?

00:59:05.110 --> 00:59:05.920
How are you doing, love?

00:59:06.140 --> 00:59:09.340
Look, I've been looking for you for ten days.

00:59:09.340 --> 00:59:10.980
Mrs. Berta...

00:59:10.980 --> 00:59:12.030
What's wrong with her?

00:59:12.350 --> 00:59:13.760
She needs you.

00:59:15.000 --> 00:59:15.240
I'm sick.

01:00:34.000 --> 01:00:36.750
Now she's calm. It's better to let her rest.

01:01:14.400 --> 01:01:17.710
You don't know what's in the clamor.

01:01:36.080 --> 01:01:59.580
Thank you!

01:02:00.180 --> 01:02:11.220
Good afternoon.

01:02:12.710 --> 01:02:13.690
Good afternoon what?

01:02:13.890 --> 01:02:15.410
Good afternoon, doctor.

01:02:15.830 --> 01:02:16.730
May I?

01:02:16.850 --> 01:02:20.640
You may.

01:02:20.920 --> 01:02:25.390
Yes, right away.

01:02:25.570 --> 01:02:25.810
Enough!

01:02:36.720 --> 01:02:37.980
How do you suffer in this life?

01:02:44.020 --> 01:02:47.960
Sir, doctor, may I?

01:02:48.360 --> 01:02:49.920
May I?

01:03:00.670 --> 01:03:01.470
He's still in pain.

01:03:11.070 --> 01:03:13.050
I ironed his shirt,

01:03:13.550 --> 01:03:16.110
I ironed his pants,

01:03:17.110 --> 01:03:19.260
and I ironed his socks.

01:03:20.870 --> 01:03:23.750
And you know what, doctor? I prepared a flan for him tonight.

01:03:24.530 --> 01:03:25.130
A flan?

01:03:25.170 --> 01:03:25.770
Yes, doctor.

01:03:26.790 --> 01:03:27.270
Burned?

01:03:28.260 --> 01:03:29.980
No flan. Tonight...

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:32.180
I want cheese and sweets, and that's enough, doctor.

01:03:32.440 --> 01:03:34.020
From now on, engineer.

01:03:34.920 --> 01:03:41.650
And now, will you allow me to ask you something?

01:03:41.910 --> 01:03:43.410
But you ask all day.

01:03:43.630 --> 01:03:46.480
Tell me, what do you want?

01:03:46.620 --> 01:03:48.220
You let me call you Negro.

01:03:48.520 --> 01:03:48.880
Not yet.

01:03:49.240 --> 01:03:51.020
But you promised me three months ago that...

01:03:51.020 --> 01:03:53.320
The Congress hasn't dealt with that matter yet.

01:03:53.840 --> 01:03:54.260
Good afternoon.

01:03:54.400 --> 01:03:57.300
How are you?

01:03:57.500 --> 01:03:58.680
Very well, how are you, Isabelita?

01:03:58.840 --> 01:03:59.480
Good afternoon, Carlos.

01:03:59.720 --> 01:03:59.760
You.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:01.220
Always early in the morning, huh?

01:04:01.320 --> 01:04:02.700
Why? What time is it?

01:04:02.880 --> 01:04:04.420
It must be around 5 o'clock, right?

01:04:04.540 --> 01:04:05.020
5 o'clock?

01:04:05.080 --> 01:04:06.900
Look, I woke up earlier today than usual.

01:04:07.160 --> 01:04:08.070
What are you doing?

01:04:08.250 --> 01:04:09.720
What am I doing?

01:04:09.920 --> 01:04:11.160
A chair for the friend.

01:04:11.660 --> 01:04:13.280
Yes, doctor. I mean, engineer.

01:04:14.540 --> 01:04:14.900
Engineer?

01:04:15.590 --> 01:04:16.230
Hurry up.

01:04:16.490 --> 01:04:17.790
Sit down, Carlos.

01:04:17.930 --> 01:04:18.210
Thank you.

01:04:19.320 --> 01:04:19.900
What are you doing?

01:04:20.180 --> 01:04:21.350
What am I doing?

01:04:21.550 --> 01:04:23.210
Here's the dough and the tortillas.

01:04:23.490 --> 01:04:25.460
Yes, right away. I already have the water ready.

01:04:27.990 --> 01:04:29.820
But, hey, Miquel, since when...

01:04:31.450 --> 01:04:32.570
Professional secret.

01:04:33.130 --> 01:04:34.750
Look, brother, give me a cigarette.

01:04:36.300 --> 01:04:39.960
At first, I had the wind against me.

01:04:39.980 --> 01:04:42.480
I received the first beating.

01:04:43.960 --> 01:04:44.300
Yes.

01:04:44.700 --> 01:04:52.260
In all serious marriage, the first slap is always given by the woman.

01:04:52.480 --> 01:04:53.840
Do I explain myself?

01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:54.220
Yes.

01:04:54.630 --> 01:04:56.750
Then everything is a matter of skill.

01:05:03.200 --> 01:05:07.070
I confess I was a coward, but one day I came in to exchange blows...

01:05:07.070 --> 01:05:07.670
What, you hit me?

01:05:07.870 --> 01:05:10.850
I put the first kiss on her, and I let her sleep.

01:05:11.570 --> 01:05:19.450
Serve yourself.

01:05:19.690 --> 01:05:22.620
Don't be rude. Serve her the visit first.

01:05:22.900 --> 01:05:24.100
Always playing cards.

01:05:24.620 --> 01:05:26.110
Bring the beer and the money.

01:05:26.380 --> 01:05:27.720
And make sure we talk to the men.

01:05:28.640 --> 01:05:29.920
No, thank you, Isabelita.

01:05:30.960 --> 01:05:34.380
I came to say hi. We'll come back. I don't want to leave her alone.

01:05:34.680 --> 01:05:36.410
Bye. I'll see you tomorrow.

01:05:36.960 --> 01:05:38.370
If that's the case, see you tomorrow.

01:06:34.540 --> 01:06:34.980
Good luck, miss.

01:06:35.360 --> 01:06:37.130
Yes, too good.

01:06:37.530 --> 01:06:38.050
No, much better.

01:06:39.620 --> 01:06:39.980
Morocho.

01:06:43.270 --> 01:06:43.630
Paraguasita.

01:06:48.190 --> 01:06:48.990
It didn't go very well.

01:06:49.150 --> 01:06:51.080
I got the bad one.

01:06:52.560 --> 01:06:52.900
Charly.

01:06:52.940 --> 01:06:56.850
Sara, you look great.

01:06:59.320 --> 01:06:59.860
You're the only one.

01:07:00.120 --> 01:07:03.660
I remember I have one left. I'll never get rid of it.

01:07:05.100 --> 01:07:06.220
That's how I like you.

01:07:07.820 --> 01:07:11.450
Carlos, I heard Doña Berta was operated on. How is she?

01:07:11.710 --> 01:07:13.230
She can't be seen yet.

01:07:15.560 --> 01:07:18.100
Why don't you make a promise to the Virgin of Luján Morocho?

01:07:20.820 --> 01:07:22.500
I'm no good for those things.

01:07:24.320 --> 01:07:27.320
You have to do it to heal, you know?

01:08:31.120 --> 01:08:40.180
They tired me of sewing so much and want to lock you up before time.

01:08:41.760 --> 01:08:47.550
Don't be shy.

01:08:47.710 --> 01:08:49.920
I love the old woman so much.

01:08:49.920 --> 01:08:52.060
You have to understand me.

01:08:53.460 --> 01:08:57.460
I don't know how to heal her eyes.

01:08:58.800 --> 01:08:59.140
I promise.

01:09:07.200 --> 01:09:08.000
You

01:09:30.190 --> 01:09:34.230
Tell me, do you know how the mother of the Morucho follows?

01:09:34.250 --> 01:09:35.280
The mother of the Morucho?

01:09:35.280 --> 01:09:36.740
I don't know.

01:09:47.620 --> 01:09:59.240
Ten is eight.

01:10:00.540 --> 01:10:00.740
It can.

01:10:00.900 --> 01:10:04.430
It can? How does life go, brother?

01:10:04.790 --> 01:10:06.350
And how many things happen suddenly?

01:10:06.760 --> 01:10:10.250
Well, you can't imagine, everything went well for you.

01:10:10.390 --> 01:10:14.100
You know something, black?

01:10:14.340 --> 01:10:14.700
Yes.

01:10:15.300 --> 01:10:15.480
Guess.

01:10:15.840 --> 01:10:16.120
No.

01:10:16.860 --> 01:10:18.730
This mate is washed.

01:10:19.240 --> 01:10:19.920
Washed, black?

01:10:20.320 --> 01:10:20.840
Yes, black.

01:10:21.240 --> 01:10:22.820
Well, I'll change the yerba right away.

01:10:23.300 --> 01:10:29.350
What was missing now is that I...

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:31.500
I could get you a contract, Morocho.

01:10:32.640 --> 01:10:34.720
Tell me something, what about the promise?

01:10:34.940 --> 01:10:37.700
You forgot about the promise to the Virgin of Lucan.

01:10:37.800 --> 01:10:38.800
I didn't forget, Michele.

01:10:38.940 --> 01:10:41.500
But where do I get money to buy two eyes of glitter?

01:10:41.920 --> 01:10:44.400
It doesn't matter, you have to go the same way to thank her.

01:10:44.520 --> 01:10:46.310
The other, you take it when you can.

01:10:47.420 --> 01:10:49.360
You're right, you have to do it.

01:10:51.570 --> 01:10:52.190
You're welcome, Carlos.

01:10:52.430 --> 01:10:53.370
Thank you, Isabelita.

01:10:57.550 --> 01:10:59.510
What a great mother you are, that there are visitors.

01:11:00.570 --> 01:11:04.330
Oh, and you call me early tomorrow, at 11 o'clock.

01:11:04.700 --> 01:11:06.160
But Negro, what are you going to do at dawn?

01:11:06.760 --> 01:11:07.980
Morocho and I have to...

01:11:07.980 --> 01:11:10.300
Well, enough. You investigate me.

01:11:10.680 --> 01:11:12.230
What's up, Carlos?

01:11:39.310 --> 01:11:45.350
They are very similar, they are the children of that beautiful Paraguayita.

01:11:45.570 --> 01:11:48.960
Yes, that's a voice.

01:11:53.410 --> 01:11:57.130
And since we agree, he is hired, here he has an advance.

01:11:58.180 --> 01:11:59.980
He sings and sings.

01:12:00.720 --> 01:12:01.610
What do you think?

01:12:02.360 --> 01:12:04.500
But it seems like a dream to me.

01:12:05.120 --> 01:12:07.460
Morocho, this is not a dream.

01:12:08.330 --> 01:12:11.810
This is... Look, you still don't know.

01:12:12.270 --> 01:12:13.480
You can't know.

01:12:14.310 --> 01:12:16.650
What do I tell you? This means that...

01:12:17.440 --> 01:12:19.180
This means that...

01:12:19.180 --> 01:12:23.840
Today, Carlos Gardel sings.

01:12:31.050 --> 01:12:32.010
Salud, IRS!

01:12:32.530 --> 01:12:34.030
What's up?

01:12:34.210 --> 01:12:35.130
Do you find me changed?

01:12:35.450 --> 01:12:36.290
It's me.

01:12:36.470 --> 01:12:36.790
And?

01:12:36.950 --> 01:12:38.360
What do you say about the uniform?

01:12:38.680 --> 01:12:39.920
It's from Adelino Cabezas.

01:12:40.160 --> 01:12:41.620
24 mensualities.

01:12:41.740 --> 01:12:42.980
But it's you, Miguelito.

01:12:43.140 --> 01:12:44.320
You look like Anchorena.

01:12:44.620 --> 01:12:45.140
Anchorena?

01:12:45.220 --> 01:12:49.060
I'd like to see you inside this neck and in these shoes.

01:12:49.520 --> 01:12:51.700
But I did it for the Morocho, Che.

01:12:52.020 --> 01:12:56.500
Because tonight, we all have to go to make strength and applaud Carlos.

01:12:56.930 --> 01:12:59.970
Because today, the Morocho, our Morocho de Lavasto...

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:03.890
He's gone mad. He's taken the heart of our neighborhood to the theater.

01:13:04.290 --> 01:13:05.330
To a real theater.

01:13:05.780 --> 01:13:08.180
You, who were thrilled by his singing.

01:13:08.500 --> 01:13:11.800
You, who applauded him here until your hands broke.

01:13:11.800 --> 01:13:13.520
Are you going to leave him alone?

01:13:14.680 --> 01:13:17.940
Huh, Boche Pipeta? What do you say?

01:13:18.570 --> 01:13:21.270
It's been 50 years since I left Labasto.

01:13:21.430 --> 01:13:23.960
I had sworn not to cross the border.

01:13:24.380 --> 01:13:28.350
But tonight, because of the morocho, I'm going abroad.

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:32.390
And you, Picado?

01:13:32.530 --> 01:13:33.620
Yes, I'm going.

01:13:33.860 --> 01:13:34.760
Look, you have to go.

01:13:35.020 --> 01:13:35.980
And your wife goes.

01:13:35.980 --> 01:13:36.800
And your sister goes.

01:13:36.960 --> 01:13:37.840
And your sister's boyfriend goes.

01:13:38.140 --> 01:13:39.000
And your girlfriend goes.

01:13:39.000 --> 01:13:40.480
And your girlfriend's sister goes.

01:13:40.480 --> 01:13:41.440
And your cousin's boyfriend goes.

01:13:41.440 --> 01:13:43.500
He's a Galician and he goes to Alcantejondo.

01:13:43.680 --> 01:13:44.560
Go and suffer.

01:13:44.980 --> 01:13:47.010
And my grandma goes too.

01:13:56.300 --> 01:13:58.350
Everyone buys tickets here.

01:13:58.900 --> 01:13:59.760
Mother, let them go.

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:02.360
Why are you talking so much? We'll be a business and we'll take it all.

01:14:04.840 --> 01:14:07.570
But I say, you're going to the theater very cold.

01:14:08.230 --> 01:14:10.730
Do you have salt?

01:14:10.890 --> 01:14:29.240
Something for tonight.

01:14:30.090 --> 01:14:31.730
What am I going to do with it? Leave it there.

01:14:32.470 --> 01:14:34.470
You just insist on going to see that little singer?

01:14:35.090 --> 01:14:35.490
Yes.

01:14:38.650 --> 01:14:41.050
It's better that you don't wear that at the moment.

01:14:41.910 --> 01:14:45.190
Why? And I'm not going to wear it? Why did you buy it for me?

01:14:45.720 --> 01:14:49.210
I got it. It's not the same.

01:14:52.700 --> 01:14:57.620
Roba, you don't lack anything.

01:15:01.720 --> 01:15:03.780
It's not for you to be like this, black girl.

01:15:03.920 --> 01:15:07.970
Look, if you let some time pass, you'll be able to use it with this other girl.

01:15:11.880 --> 01:15:13.060
Listen, Marcelo.

01:15:13.940 --> 01:15:17.160
We can't use the word deception for many things.

01:15:18.160 --> 01:15:19.720
However, you have deceived me.

01:15:20.930 --> 01:15:25.050
You've given me all this, but all this is going to cost me dearly.

01:15:25.070 --> 01:15:26.890
All my businesses are safe, don't be afraid.

01:15:27.740 --> 01:15:29.260
That's not what matters to me.

01:15:30.090 --> 01:15:31.930
Yes, I know what you care about.

01:15:32.030 --> 01:15:35.940
The only thing you have in your head is that little singer who you are going to see at the theater, right?

01:15:36.640 --> 01:15:41.220
That little singer, as you say, does not steal, does not deceive, does not know how to lie.

01:15:41.400 --> 01:15:43.580
And he gives away what he has without asking for anything in return.

01:15:43.820 --> 01:15:48.570
Because birds do not charge for singing, nor do they use a pickaxe to get into hearts.

01:15:49.300 --> 01:15:54.180
That little singer is a man, he is the only man I have ever loved in my life.

01:15:55.150 --> 01:15:56.920
Here, go and see it.

01:16:03.550 --> 01:16:29.830
I'm going to cut

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:30.960
to put the voice in the throat.

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:05.000
I went to Torro, in El Cotorro, I can't find you.

01:17:06.050 --> 01:17:13.400
I looked for you all over the room, imagining my life.

01:17:14.450 --> 01:17:20.880
You were hiding to give me a blackout.

01:17:22.200 --> 01:17:28.150
I saw that the wardrobe, the clothes had already been removed.

01:17:30.120 --> 01:17:35.140
And when I saw that you had taken it, my heart wept

01:17:36.360 --> 01:17:44.210
I thought of those days that you told me, looking at me

01:17:44.850 --> 01:17:52.100
My love is sincere and pure, and I swear I will love you

01:17:52.580 --> 01:17:59.050
And that when I give you a hug, in your eyes, tears

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:08.160
I do not know, my life, how you have been able to entangle me like this

01:18:09.220 --> 01:18:17.600
The letter of farewell that you let me leave you

01:18:17.600 --> 01:18:25.440
I said that you were going to unite with someone who gave you another love

01:18:25.440 --> 01:18:29.340
I reviewed it several times

01:18:31.760 --> 01:18:42.430
I couldn't accept that you were going to kill me for another Bacán

01:18:43.600 --> 01:18:44.960
Mejor

01:19:02.010 --> 01:19:03.130
Phenomenon number eight!

01:19:03.430 --> 01:19:03.930
Thank you.

01:19:03.930 --> 01:19:05.430
And? What do you say about my chicken?

01:19:05.690 --> 01:19:06.150
Thank you.

01:19:06.250 --> 01:19:10.870
Ana Maria, today, one day your heart as a woman will be alive.

01:19:11.070 --> 01:19:12.610
You told me it would triumph.

01:19:15.480 --> 01:19:18.290
No, you have nothing to thank me for, Carmen.

01:19:20.130 --> 01:19:21.110
Your destiny is fulfilled.

01:19:23.270 --> 01:19:25.920
Come on, I'll call you.

01:19:52.520 --> 01:19:52.600
I love you.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:06.000
You hold me and lead me to the summit of your alentive

01:20:06.000 --> 01:20:10.560
You are constancy, I am patience

01:20:11.680 --> 01:20:17.450
You are tenderness, I am piety

01:20:17.450 --> 01:20:28.520
You present independence, I symbolize freedom

01:20:36.780 --> 01:20:40.780
You know very well that I'm sick

01:20:41.196 --> 01:20:44.576
And in my semblance you can clearly see

01:20:44.748 --> 01:20:48.148
I almost can't sleep at night.

01:20:48.300 --> 01:20:51.300
I don't sleep at all, do you know why?

01:20:51.820 --> 01:20:56.620
Because I dream how I appreciate you

01:20:56.972 --> 01:20:58.972
From here to my side

01:20:59.468 --> 01:20:59.968
but

01:21:00.440 --> 01:21:13.210
I have bad dreams, stupid silences, but my life, what am I going to do?

01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:44.230
I am very sorry for the painful situation that many times for looking for calm I take my hair to the diapason

01:21:44.510 --> 01:21:54.820
of your despise never complain because if you do it, you will have to pay for me

01:22:00.000 --> 01:22:06.200
Love me always, don't be so bad, let's go to Granada

01:22:50.280 --> 01:22:54.200
And look at me, I'm shaking. I never thought that...

01:22:54.200 --> 01:22:54.940
Come out, come out again!

01:22:55.360 --> 01:22:55.420
Yes.

01:22:55.480 --> 01:22:57.040
Come out, come out morocho, the room is full.

01:22:57.380 --> 01:22:57.620
I'm going.

01:22:57.800 --> 01:22:59.470
And now...

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:00.440
Will you give him a kiss?

01:23:01.800 --> 01:23:02.720
Now, yes, Carlo.

01:23:10.730 --> 01:23:11.510
Leave him, Ana Maria.

01:23:12.700 --> 01:23:13.980
He's not only ours anymore.

01:23:14.680 --> 01:23:15.180
Yes, yes.

01:23:15.180 --> 01:23:16.500
Of course I'll leave him.

01:23:16.620 --> 01:23:19.850
I have to let him go.

01:23:21.120 --> 01:23:21.400
Goodbye.

01:23:23.040 --> 01:23:23.920
Goodbye, Carlo.

01:23:31.530 --> 01:23:32.410
Come on, let's go out to dinner.

01:23:32.670 --> 01:23:33.670
Yes, Estabelita, let's go.

01:23:33.770 --> 01:23:35.030
But they won't let us in?

01:23:35.330 --> 01:23:36.930
Of course, how can they not let us in? Let's go.

01:23:43.520 --> 01:23:44.160
Marcello Pardal.

01:23:44.240 --> 01:23:44.400
Where?

01:23:44.720 --> 01:23:44.900
There.

01:23:45.160 --> 01:23:50.910
Wait, that's Paraguayita's husband.

01:23:50.950 --> 01:23:51.230
Yes.

01:23:51.470 --> 01:23:53.490
Come here, I don't like this at all.

01:23:58.380 --> 01:23:58.700
Carlitos.

01:24:00.000 --> 01:24:02.810
between the public and its admirers.

01:24:02.870 --> 01:24:05.090
Where will you always be from today?

01:24:05.250 --> 01:24:06.320
Give me the coat.

01:24:06.840 --> 01:24:07.400
What? You're leaving?

01:24:07.680 --> 01:24:09.290
Yes, but why?

01:24:09.630 --> 01:24:12.500
Don't you realize that from today I don't belong anymore?

01:24:12.500 --> 01:24:13.910
That I've lost it forever.

01:24:14.430 --> 01:24:15.530
I don't understand you.

01:24:16.740 --> 01:24:19.450
You're right. It's hard to understand.

01:24:57.710 --> 01:24:59.370
It has many admirers today, right?

01:25:00.030 --> 01:25:02.090
Maybe not all of them are admirers.

01:25:02.310 --> 01:25:04.070
You don't have anything to do here. Get out of here.

01:25:05.080 --> 01:25:06.880
You're kicking me out, Burruchaga.

01:25:07.140 --> 01:25:08.460
Get out of here, you bastard.

01:25:19.090 --> 01:25:20.070
Wait for me at home.

01:25:32.810 --> 01:25:33.190
Who was it?

01:25:34.280 --> 01:25:35.080
Marcelo Pardales.

01:25:35.810 --> 01:25:36.670
Marcelo Pardales?

01:25:36.890 --> 01:25:37.010
Yes.

01:25:37.230 --> 01:25:39.430
He came to kill you, Morocho.

01:25:39.530 --> 01:25:40.010
To kill me?

01:25:40.170 --> 01:25:40.450
Why?

01:25:40.790 --> 01:25:42.400
Because he's my husband.

01:25:42.740 --> 01:25:46.640
Why did you do that?

01:25:47.270 --> 01:25:48.330
It was for her, Morocho.

01:25:48.490 --> 01:25:52.060
You had to return the gauchada that night.

01:25:52.440 --> 01:25:54.380
We loved each other.

01:25:56.470 --> 01:25:57.030
We loved each other.

01:26:00.090 --> 01:26:05.340
Carlos, what can I say? I'm a woman of bad luck.

01:27:02.040 --> 01:27:02.440
What's the matter?

01:27:04.370 --> 01:27:05.070
What a night, brother.

01:27:05.390 --> 01:27:07.540
A night like any other.

01:27:09.180 --> 01:27:09.840
Like any other?

01:27:09.980 --> 01:27:12.730
But you realize everything that happened.

01:27:13.240 --> 01:27:14.580
Life is like that, you see.

01:27:16.010 --> 01:27:17.190
Ana María is holding me back.

01:27:17.190 --> 01:27:18.490
Maybe she wants to leave me forever.

01:27:20.710 --> 01:27:25.800
A love wants to go out of the arms of oblivion.

01:27:25.820 --> 01:27:27.430
And a friendship wants to go away.

01:27:30.480 --> 01:27:31.240
And you have to keep going?

01:27:31.520 --> 01:27:36.100
No, Carlos, I plan.

01:27:36.320 --> 01:27:36.500
What?

01:27:37.170 --> 01:27:37.450
Yes.

01:27:38.390 --> 01:27:40.920
I accompanied you while you were the morocho of the gang.

01:27:41.730 --> 01:27:42.710
Now you're Carlos.

01:27:43.440 --> 01:27:44.280
And what about that?

01:27:44.760 --> 01:27:45.980
That I know I can't go on.

01:27:46.080 --> 01:27:46.810
I am.

01:27:46.870 --> 01:27:48.390
I will be your best friend.

01:27:49.130 --> 01:27:49.410
But...

01:27:49.410 --> 01:27:51.290
I was not born to use it.

01:27:51.880 --> 01:27:53.160
Are you also going to abandon me now?

01:27:53.380 --> 01:27:53.620
No.

01:27:53.760 --> 01:27:55.490
I don't abandon you, morocho.

01:27:55.610 --> 01:27:57.670
I understand that you start a new life.

01:27:57.930 --> 01:27:59.080
That you go to the center.

01:28:00.990 --> 01:28:02.470
Look, Michele, I can't do without you.

01:28:03.250 --> 01:28:04.450
I have a song-filled soul.

01:28:04.510 --> 01:28:07.810
I feel that it's my destiny and I can't avoid it.

01:28:09.100 --> 01:28:09.960
Like a message, Sam.

01:28:10.650 --> 01:28:14.830
Like a message from my heart to my Buenos Aires.

01:28:17.140 --> 01:28:17.480
Carlitos!

01:28:19.400 --> 01:28:21.540
But whatever happens, I'll always come back to the bar.

01:28:22.820 --> 01:28:25.360
Even if it's just to stop my ear and listen to what you say.

01:28:27.160 --> 01:28:29.760
Cheers, Morocho. And you'll come back with me.

01:28:31.150 --> 01:28:31.530
Let's have a cigarette.

01:28:34.490 --> 01:28:36.340
No, I don't want to.

01:28:36.980 --> 01:28:37.340
Cheers.

01:28:39.180 --> 01:28:39.920
I don't feel like it.

01:28:45.040 --> 01:28:45.880
It's late, Morocho.

01:28:46.020 --> 01:28:48.460
Come on, you have a lot to do tomorrow.

01:28:48.650 --> 01:28:50.060
So, are you really going?

01:28:50.220 --> 01:28:54.930
Yes, you're confusing me.

01:28:55.290 --> 01:28:55.790
Come on, Morocho!

01:28:55.930 --> 01:28:56.170
Okay.

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:01.870
Let's do it, brother. As long as you want.

01:29:02.010 --> 01:29:04.920
As long as you want, Morocho.

01:29:11.680 --> 01:29:14.350
Now, goodbye, Carlos Gardel.

01:29:14.550 --> 01:29:16.840
What? Here's Morocho.

01:29:16.980 --> 01:29:18.590
Look, he's going to die.

01:29:18.930 --> 01:29:20.730
No, kid, he's not going to die.

01:29:21.040 --> 01:29:22.660
Now is when he's going to stay.

01:29:35.210 --> 01:29:36.090
I'll never see you again.
